## Open boundaries and next action

This closes actual capability safety preflight only. The trustworthy Action.Id-to-mutation binding and before/after comparability / contamination conditions are not proved by this regression; do not enable the generic runtime host until those boundaries are validated. The approved next Track 6 item 3 Slice 4 is in-memory, atomic cooldown + Action Budget, conservatively scoped to generic live canary attempts, without inventing fixed numerical defaults or claiming to implement all historical per-category budgets. Runtime host integration remains subsequent.

